  "changelog": "新增头像名单、宽屏双栏、未读筛选和关注多选。使用相关功能时可申请缺少的权限。请先更新 FluxDO，再从原市场来源更新以保留订阅。",
  "requiredFeatures": ["forumRead", "navigationEntries", "navigationBadge", "scheduledTasks", "localNotifications", "atomicStorage", "runtimePermissions", "adaptiveCollections", "modalDismiss"]
